					<box topPadding="5" leftPadding="10" rightPadding="10"/>
					<textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10" isBold="true"/>
						<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
					</textElement>
					<textFieldExpression><![CDATA[($F{mailingInfoEntityName1}==null?"":$F{mailingInfoEntityName1})+"<br />"+
($F{mailingInfoAddress1}==null?"":$F{mailingInfoAddress1})+
($F{mailingInfoAddress2}==null?"":", "+$F{mailingInfoAddress2})+
($F{mailingInfoAddress3}==null?"":", "+$F{mailingInfoAddress3})+
($F{mailingInfoAddress4}==null?"":", "+$F{mailingInfoAddress4})+"<br />"+
($F{mailingInfoCity}==null?"":$F{mailingInfoCity})+
($F{mailingInfoState}==null?"":", "+$F{mailingInfoState})+ 
($F{mailingInfoPostal}==null?"":" "+" "+$F{mailingInfoPostal})]]></textFieldExpression>
				</textField>
			</frame>
		</band>
		<band height="110" splitType="Stretch">
			<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
			<frame>
				<reportElement x="0" y="0" width="572" height="110" uuid="74b851a6-3e32-4786-90d4-2334cdaa2287"/>
				<textField textAdjust="StretchHeight" isBlankWhenNull="true">
					<reportElement stretchType="RelativeToBandHeight" x="0" y="0" width="572" height="110" uuid="95d0e317-8ea0-48bb-ba9e-992431a4ad6e">
						<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
						<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.y" value="px"/>
					</reportElement>
					<box topPadding="2" leftPadding="10" bottomPadding="2" rightPadding="10"/>
					<textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html">
						<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10"/>
						<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
					</textElement>
					<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["RE: ACCOUNT: "+($F{accountId}==null?"":$F{accountId})+"<br />"+
"LOCATION: "+($F{address1}==null?"":$F{address1})+"<br /><br/>"+

"Dear Customer:<br /><br />"+

"Our records indicate that the credit rating for this account has dropped. If you believe this to be in error, or have questions concerning this letter or your account, please do not hesitate to contact our Business Office at 479/968-2105.<br /><br />"+

"In accordance to City Corporation's Deposit Policy, the Utility may require a deposit from any existing customer (equal to two and one-half (2 1/2) times the average monthly bill for service rendered):<br /><br />"+

"a. Whose service has been discontinued for non-payment of a delinquent account."+"<br />"+
"b. Who has given two (2) invalid checks in the past twelve (12) months."+"<br />"+
"c. Who has failed to pay their bill by the due date twice within the past twelve (12) months."+"<br />"+
"d. Who has misrepresented their identity for the purpose of abtaining service."+"<br />"+
"e. Who has turned their water on again after it has been turned off for any violation of rules, installed a jumper pipe to obtain services without having paid a deposit for services or failed to pay his delinquent bill.<br /><br />"+

"In case you are interested, we offer a bank draft plan. Many of our customers find it convenient for us to draft their monthly invoice directly from their bank account. For more information visit www.citycorporation.com or contact our Business Office to request a form be mailed to you.<br /><br />"+

"We appreciate your attention to this matter."]]></textFieldExpression>
				</textField>
			</frame>
		</band>
